The virtual keyboard and pointer.
.TP
.I scripts/genesis-uinput.rules
The udev rule that makes /dev/uinput hers.
.TP
.I scripts/genesis-sudoers
The NOPASSWD template for \fBrun_privileged\fR.
.TP
.I scripts/install_optional_deps.sh
Installs and verifies every optional capability.
.TP
